  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, a chessmaster can take a moment to plot and plan - granting him 2 + 1 per 4 levels edge points as a standard action. As part of this same standard action he may make a Knowledge check to attempt to identify one creature that he can see. If he succeeds, he gains 2 extra edge points. He may not identify a creature more than once in the same 24 hour period.</p>\n<p>If he is at least 4th level, he may attempt to identify all creatures within his field of vision as part of this standard action- making independent Knowledge check for each. For every creature he successfully identifies, he gains 2 edge points.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/chessmaster-gonzo#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
